Here n(A) = 3, so n(P(A)) = 2³ = 8.
Subsets:
• 0-element subset: ∅
• 1-element subsets: {1}, {2}, {3}
• 2-element subsets: {1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}
• 3-element subset: {1, 2, 3}
P(A) = { ∅, {1}, {2}, {3}, {1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}, {1, 2, 3} }.

1. Left Hand Side (LHS):
A ∪ B = {2, 4, 6}
(A ∪ B)' = U - (A ∪ B) = {1, 3, 5}.
2. Right Hand Side (RHS):
A' = U - A = {1, 3, 5, 6}
B' = U - B = {1, 2, 3, 5}
A' ∩ B' = {1, 3, 5}.
LHS = RHS = {1, 3, 5}. Hence proved.

